  "comments": "<p>SCWC also mention this type of coin in bronze (instead of copper), KM#4.2a. Other local catalogs (Morin (2012), Aernout (2019)) do not mention these types.<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/58451598f414a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/58451598f414a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>KM# 4.1: Wide rim, with or without point in signature, 1833 - 1835 (LA# 8, Morin 87-89a)<br>KM# 4.2: Narrow rim, with point in signature, 1835 - 1865 (LA# 9, Morin 89b-113)<br>KM# 4.3: Medal alignment, 1833 - 1836<br>KM# 4.4: Narrow rim, without point in signature, 1835 - 1861<br><br>Struck on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://fr.numista.com/6540\">Dutch 1 cent</a>.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cbbf4a0430b6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cbbf4a0430b6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/620c7cf242b98.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/620c7cf242b98.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><u>1860</u>: two different sizes of the date<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/640e0ae54a54d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/640e0ae54a54d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/640e0af3456ee.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/640e0af3456ee.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><u>1863</u></p><p>Overdate 8/8 variety.</p><p>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/65f9f43f01791.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/65f9f43f01791.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;3 in date<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/62ee80b382273.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/62ee80b382273.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><u>Catalog inconsistencies</u>:<br>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Morin does not mention a 1833 type without period<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Morin and Aernout do not recognize 1834 in medal alignment<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The 1845 date size variety is not recognized by Aernout<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The 1850 coin is not recognized by Aernout, although it states that some coins of 1849 were actually minted in 1850. This makes its existence doubtful<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The 1852 date size variety is not recognized by Aernout<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The 1856 date size variety is not recognized by Aernout<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The 1857 coin withouth signature is not recognized by Morin or Aernout<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The overdate variety 1858/47 is not recognized by Morin or Aernout<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The 1860 coin with normal O is not recognized by Aernout or SCWC<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The 1862 date size variety is not recognized by Aernout<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>",
